{"id":"9758d74f9a5e939a","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-representability.md","title":"Representability in Smullyan’s Sense","display":"df-smullyan-representability — Representability in Smullyan’s Sense","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-representability","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-representability"],"display":"df-smullyan-representability — Representability in Smullyan’s Sense","source":"第 I 章 p. 12 练习 2；第 V 章 pp. 58–59（PDF 29、75–76）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]","[[92-df-formula-instance]]","[[92-df-provable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-representability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-representability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-representability — Representability in Smullyan’s Sense"},{"key":"source","html":"第 I 章 p. 12 练习 2；第 V 章 pp. 58–59（PDF 29、75–76）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"62f011418ee9c44e\" href=\"?note=62f011418ee9c44e\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-system\">92-df-arithmetic-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\mid i&lt;k\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\mid i&lt;k\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k\">\\(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k\\)</span> 是<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a>的无捕获实例操作；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A),\\mathrm{SRepSet}_{\\mathcal S}^k(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A),\\mathrm{SRepSet}_{\\mathcal S}^k(A)\\)</span> 是下文定义的公式表示关系及存在公式的集合性质。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}representability}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec n\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SRepSet}_{\\mathcal S}^k(A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\mid i&lt;k\\}\\land\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}representability}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec n\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SRepSet}_{\\mathcal S}^k(A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\mid i&lt;k\\}\\land\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>非成员条件是“该实例不可证”，而不是“其否定可证”。所以一个 c.e. 但不可判定集合可以在 P.A. 中按此意义可表示。真值集合在定义中完全不出现。原库的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> 采用正负实例的数码可证明条件，应按<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a>的修订说明理解为 numeralwise definition。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 I 章 p. 12 练习 2；第 V 章 pp. 58–59（PDF 29、75–76）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-system","status":"resolved","id":"62f011418ee9c44e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula-instance","status":"resolved","id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula-instance]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula-instance","status":"resolved","id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k$ 是[[92-df-formula-instance]]的无捕获实例操作；$\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A),\\mathrm{SRepSet}_{\\mathcal S}^k(A)$ 是下文定义的公式表示关系及存在公式的集合性质。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"非成员条件是“该实例不可证”，而不是“其否定可证”。所以一个 c.e. 但不可判定集合可以在 P.A. 中按此意义可表示。真值集合在定义中完全不出现。原库的 $\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ 采用正负实例的数码可证明条件，应按[[92-df-representable]]的修订说明理解为 numeralwise definition。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\mid i<k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A),\\mathrm{SRepSet}_{\\mathcal S}^k(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}representability}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec n\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SRepSet}_{\\mathcal S}^k(A)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\mid i<k\\}\\land\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rep}_G","display":false}],"bytes":1911,"backlinks":[{"id":"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 representable in $S$ 指成员关系恰好对应正实例可证；本库旧 $\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ 指正负数码实例可证，即 proof-theoretic definability。参见[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]、[[92-df-complete-representability]]与[[92-df-representable]]。Normal/Stable 是元语言的可证性封闭性质，见[[92-df-normal-stable-system]]；序数正规函数另属扩展材料。"},{"id":"e5790b58acf0fb1c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k$ 来自[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]；$\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k$ 来自[[92-df-formula-instance]]。"},{"id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"沿用 $\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ 标签与符号，实际语义是原书第 VIII 章的 numeralwise definition：正确正实例与正确负实例分别可证。它不是原书第 V 章 representable 的“成员当且仅当正实例可证”。普通表示见[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]；完全表示的双条件见[[92-df-complete-representability]]；一致性把本定义的同一见证提升为完全表示，见[[92-lem-definition-complete-representation]]。"},{"id":"905868da4e6087cf","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2121ca396d7d67ab","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8a3cbbd03d905ffa","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]、[[92-df-enumerability-in-system]]、[[92-lem-omega-enumeration]]与[[92-df-omega-consistency]]给出原书关于表示和 $\\omega$ 相容性的契约。本地固定 PA 的对应结果见[[92-thm-first-incompleteness]]与[[92-thm-omega-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-182","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]"}],"outgoing":["62f011418ee9c44e","8bd18c4d476f594a","51c43e0240787ebb","d9d845f6cd765d21"]}